   "line": 23,
   "message": "MOD.md and README.md tell users to uninstall an old separate `specclaw-mod@chan4lk` plugin and say it 'still blocks edits by default'. The whole-change diff against main adds no `specclaw-mod` entry to `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` and removes none, so that plugin never shipped from main and no marketplace user can have it. Either drop the note or limit it to people who installed from this branch. As written, it documents behaviour of a plugin that was never released.",
